WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:01.708 line:0%
It's showtime, y'all.

00:00:02.125 --> 00:00:03.458 line:0%
You love him and I love him.

00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:05.542 line:0%
Put your hands together.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.625
Dolemite is my name!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.250
Dolemite.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.667
Auntie, I was thinking
about putting out

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.375
-a comedy record.
-Comedy?

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:16.958
You been a singer,
a Shake dancer...

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:18.625
It's real hard to break in.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:20.583
I'll do whatever it takes
to get in.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.500
I come up
with a new character.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.375
Dolemite is my name,

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.375
and fuckin' up motherfuckers
is my game.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.667
What you do to your hair?
You look like a pimp.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.583
It's all pretend.
I just created a character.

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:38.917
-You a trip.
-Pull on that.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.125
-That's a wig.
-A wig, that's right.

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.167
Whatever it takes,
I'm ready to do it.

00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:47.208
I got to be totally outrageous.

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:48.833
It's filthy.

00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:51.458
You've got a product here
that you can't sell

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:52.917
or promote.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.125
All my life
people been telling me no.

00:00:57.417 --> 00:00:59.833
Rudy, sometimes our dreams
just don't come true.

00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:02.958
A man slam a door in my face,
I just find another door.

00:01:03.042 --> 00:01:04.792
I want the world
to know I exist.

00:01:06.917 --> 00:01:08.000
This ain't funny.

00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.000
And it ain't no brothers
in it either.

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:14.458
If I get up in that light
with my own movie,

00:01:14.542 --> 00:01:16.625
I could be everywhere
all at once.

00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:18.333
Let's bring Dolemite
to the screen.

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:21.333
The actors we hire,

00:01:21.417 --> 00:01:23.917
you're a bit doughier
than them.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.958
Doughier?

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:30.875
That's D'Urville Martin.

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.792
I'm offering you a role
in my new motion picture.

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:36.125
You think you can just
walk up here and hire me?

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:38.292
-No.
-What if we let you direct?

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:44.250
In storytelling, it's always
best to write what you know.

00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.500
Ain't nothing to talk about
in my personal life.

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.292
I deal with the nightlife.
Club owners and mobsters,

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.708
lots of pimps and kung fu.

00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:54.667
-Do you know karate?
-No, but I'm a fast learner.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:56.917
I can learn
how to chop me a mother--

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.292
Action.

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.167
-Dolemite, give it to me.
-Put your weight on it.

00:02:08.042 --> 00:02:09.958
Pretending like
he could be a sex machine.

00:02:10.042 --> 00:02:12.208
What planet is this cat on?

00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:16.167
-Damn!
-This thing flops,

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.292
you're working for free
the rest of your life.

00:02:18.375 --> 00:02:20.833
I'm so grateful
for what you did for me,

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.875
'cause I never seen nobody
that looks like me...

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:27.208
-Oh, yeah!
-...up there on that big screen.

00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:37.042
God damn, Dolemite.

00:02:43.417 --> 00:02:45.250
-Cut.
-Was it as good as Shaft?

